["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"The Domino’s Pizza Tracker Theory of Everything labor illusion out-the-door time pizza tracker\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-18-planetmoney-披萨追踪器-我们被驯化成愿意为假进度条买单/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dfad6d18e39a82db-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">32:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Planet Money</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>披萨追踪器：我们被驯化成愿意为假进度条买单</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Domino&#x27;s 的披萨追踪器最初只是内部管理工具，后来变成全球 App 的标配。它之所以有效，是因为它把等待变成了看得见的工作；而当公司发现我们爱看进度条，就开始造假进度条。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">产品设计</span><span class=\"tag\">消费者心理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"On $L^p$ Density of Self-Similar Measures and Continuous Bernoulli Convolutions - Constantin Kogler self-similar measure Bernoulli convolution absolutely continuous L^p density Lean\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-18-instituteforad-ai-半小时证出人类一年没做出的数学定理/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c3e280b6f6fbcbd0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">59:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">InstituteForAdvancedStudy</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>AI 半小时证出人类一年没做出的数学定理</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一个被卡住的 L^p 问题，AI 用半小时给出五页证明，把 60 页的论文压缩成核心引理，还顺手把连续密度的门槛从 588 推到 9。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">数学</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 证明</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Looney Tunes animator Chuck Jones / Remembering singer Cassandra Wilson yes session scatting Acme Corporation\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-18-freshair-乐一通-动画师-角色不是画出来的-是想出来的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9b48c92c9b28c25a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">46:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Fresh Air</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>《乐一通》动画师：角色不是画出来的，是想出来的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Chuck Jones 说动画的关键不是角色长什么样、怎么画，而是「他是谁」——他先理解角色，才让 Daffy 同时怯懦又跋扈，让兔八哥必须先被招惹才反击。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">动画</span><span class=\"tag\">角色设计</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The last IMO problem AI could not solve Lean Erdős-Szekeres theorem motivated explanation LIS / LDS\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-18-karpathy-ai-解不出的最后一道-imo-题-价值不在答案/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a156d48d62c56e56-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">51:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Andrej Karpathy</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>AI 解不出的最后一道 IMO 题，价值不在答案</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">2025 年 IMO 第六题只有不到 1% 的选手拿满分，所有 AI 都卡在这题上。它难的不是计算，是必须先理解、先有审美，再动笔——而这恰恰是强化学习最难训练的东西。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 与数学</span><span class=\"tag\">IMO</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Jared Isaacman: A New Era for NASA and American Space Exploration NEP MMRTG closed Brayton cycle TRL in-situ resource utilization\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-18-allin-nasa-局长-我们不是采购机构-是核动力-nasa/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/432889fb9b668f60-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">38:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>NASA 局长：我们不是采购机构，是核动力 NASA</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Jared Isaacman 说 NASA 过去把资源摊到每个选区、为合作而合作，结果月球火箭效率不如土星五号；他要做的是核动力与核推进，把近地轨道交给 SpaceX 这类公司。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">航天</span><span class=\"tag\">核动力</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Trying to Save the World Is No Excuse John Doe delta hedge BDC target date fund\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-18-moneystuff-想拯救世界-不是搞垄断协议的借口/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c95a1585c224dc58-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">38:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Money Stuff</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>想拯救世界，不是搞垄断协议的借口</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 实验室想联手放慢模型开发，但四家巨头坐下来谈减速，法律上就是教科书式的反垄断合谋——想拯救世界不构成抗辩。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 竞赛</span><span class=\"tag\">反垄断</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The State of Startups in 2026 harness RL environments codegen system of record egocentric data\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-18-ycsp-硬科技占-yc-批次两成-软件公司正在被智能体吃掉/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9835cc1816c0414b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">36:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Y Combinator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>硬科技占 YC 批次两成：软件公司正在被智能体吃掉</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">YC 最新批次里硬科技公司从 8% 涨到 20%，机器人、国防、半导体、电力全线翻倍；同时软件公司从卖工具转向卖「把活干完」，中位收入从 8K 涨到 20K。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">硬科技</span><span class=\"tag\">智能体</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"The Sweetest Thing potency volatiles optogenetics erythrolose\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-18-radiolab-最甜的东西可能不是糖-而是照进脑子的一束光/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/97fefade0b968e40-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">31:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Radiolab</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>最甜的东西可能不是糖，而是照进脑子的一束光</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">按「甜度」排名，糖并不是最甜的；但按你实际尝到的甜，糖几乎无法被超越。更颠覆的是，用激光直接点亮甜味神经元，理论上能造出人类从未尝过的甜。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">味觉</span><span class=\"tag\">神经科学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"E252 公积金新规来了，这笔钱该怎么用？这份行动清单供你参考 转移支付 职业年金 个人养老金\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-18-zhixing-公积金新规-能取则取-但别把它当存款/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0641b913c2f67c2e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"知\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">知行小酒馆</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>公积金新规：能取则取，但别把它当存款</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">公积金不是随时能取的存款，虚假提取会被追责且三年内不能再取；但新规把租房提到提取首位、取消房租占收入比例限制，该取的钱还是该取。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">公积金</span><span class=\"tag\">房地产</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"A.I. Safety Goes Mainstream + a ‘Hard Fork’ Exit AMA PDOOM embedded evaluators base model finishing school low concept\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-18-hardfork-ai-高管集体求监管-连加速派也开始发怵/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2c10adc5f3811ac6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">1:24:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Hard Fork</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>AI 高管集体求监管：连加速派也开始发怵</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Dario Amodei 呼吁在 AI 公司内部派驻常驻评估员，Altman、Musk、Hassabis 跟进——平时几乎什么都不同意的竞争对手，第一次公开说出私下说了多年的话。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">监管</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"CLARITY Failed, Many Stablecoins Debate, Circle Launches Arc &amp; Meta&#x27;s AI Edge | Weekly Roundup TSVS NMS stock transfer agent DAT CPN\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-18-empire-稳定币不是双寡头-大公司要发自己的币/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d849bf677b8fa83d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Empire（Blockworks）</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>稳定币不是双寡头：大公司要发自己的币</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">多稳定币论战回归：Rob 说他知道有跨国公司正在发自己的稳定币，Circle 的 USDC 网络效应被低估，但利率降到 2-3% 时它的收入会腰斩。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">稳定币</span><span class=\"tag\">代币化证券</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"The Fed Is Hiking Into A Growth Slowdown | Weekly Roundup terms of trade R minus G regulatory capture SPR dot plot\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-18-forwardguidanc-美联储加息撞上增长放缓-欧洲要重走日本贬值老路/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/446b9f7d49819e61-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">1:12:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Forward Guidance</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>美联储加息撞上增长放缓，欧洲要重走日本贬值老路</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美联储在增长见顶时启动加息，而过去一年撑住美国消费的三四千亿美元「隐形中期刺激」正在退潮；Vincent Deluard 认为欧洲今天的处境就是 2012 年的日本，最终只能靠货币贬值解决。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美联储</span><span class=\"tag\">滞胀</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"687. Are Prediction Markets the Best Forecasting Tool Ever — or Just Another Casino? prediction market CFTC self-certification MNPI KYC decision market\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-18-freakonomics-预测市场不是赌场-但九成交易量来自体育/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2668c2a741e435d1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">48:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Freakonomics Radio</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>预测市场不是赌场，但九成交易量来自体育</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Kalshi 用四年合规换来九成市场份额，但它的收入结构更像博彩公司；真正被低估的是 FDA 审批这类安静市场。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">预测市场</span><span class=\"tag\">监管合规</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why Diffusion Will Win AI Inference with Inception Co-Founder and CEO Stefano Ermon diffusion model autoregressive model perplexity serving engine RL post-training\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-18-nopriors-扩散模型不是图像专利-它要在推理时赢下语言模型/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3d0b6b28d73eac46-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">38:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>扩散模型不是图像专利，它要在推理时赢下语言模型</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">自回归推理必须一个 token 一个 token 顺序生成，是内存带宽瓶颈；扩散模型一次并行处理多个 token，推理负载更像训练，所以 Inception 押它。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">扩散模型</span><span class=\"tag\">推理效率</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Sibling Fights: When to Step In (and When to Stay Out) sportscaster mode emotion coaching glass child\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-18-raisinggh-孩子打架时-当证人别当法官/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/128bd49e9267d192-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">38:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Raising Good Humans</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>孩子打架时，当证人别当法官</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">公平不等于平等：给每个孩子他需要的，而不是一模一样的东西。父母要做的不是裁决谁对谁错，而是描述发生了什么，让他们自己找到下一步。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">育儿</span><span class=\"tag\">兄弟姐妹</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"There&#x27;s a Mind-Boggling Number of Rich People in America pass-through S-Corp search fund LBO\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-18-oddlots-美国最富的一群人-藏在小生意里/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">59:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>美国最富的一群人，藏在小生意里</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美国收入不平等加剧的一半来自 pass-through 企业收入，而这类企业主不是科技巨头，是汽车经销商、啤酒分销商、牙医和卖热狗的——他们被当成「小企业」保护了四十年。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">税收</span><span class=\"tag\">财富不平等</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"OpenAI&#x27;s waiting game, gas pump pain, and severe sulfur strain! confidential S1 counterfactual metric ton\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-18-indicator-openai-不上市的理由是安全-你信吗/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dfad6d18e39a82db-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">9:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Indicator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>OpenAI 不上市的理由是安全，你信吗</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Altman 说现在上市「不明智」，理由是安全；但同一时间 OpenAI 在谈 1.2 万亿美元融资，CFO 却被排除在投资人会议之外。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">OpenAI</span><span class=\"tag\">IPO</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"100 Objects #18: Hair Relaxer creamy crack lye conk HBCU uterine fibroids\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-18-ninepi-直发剂让黑人女性变美-也让她们付出健康代价/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ac66d20d6cb97253-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"9\"><span class=\"dur\">35:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">99% Invisible</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>直发剂让黑人女性变美，也让她们付出健康代价</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">化学直发剂既建起了黑人社区最早的百万富翁产业，也被研究指向子宫癌风险升高——同一件产品同时是经济阶梯和身体代价。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">消费史</span><span class=\"tag\">公共卫生</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"How a Broken Arm Improved my French - with David Epstein mere urgency effect pre-registration HARKing replication crisis Hemingway principle\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-18-cautionary-断臂逼出的法语满分-限制才是创造力的引擎/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b996da73a08744ac-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">42:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Cautionary Tales</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>断臂逼出的法语满分：限制才是创造力的引擎</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">David Epstein 摔断手臂后被迫用图像记忆代替速记，法语反而考满分；伦敦地铁罢工两天，很多人找到了更好的通勤路线。限制不是障碍，是逼你实验的开关。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>12</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">创造力</span><span class=\"tag\">限制</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Nick Shirley: Exposing Government Fraud, Suing California &amp; Taking on the Media immigration support service providers AB2624 / Stop Nick Shirley Act change order delays SNAP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-18-allin-加州为了让一个-24-岁博主闭嘴-专门立了一部法/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/51224d453a524a2f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">32:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>加州为了让一个 24 岁博主闭嘴，专门立了一部法</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">加州对调查者的反击不是否认，而是立法：他一旦上传拍到的画面，先罚 4000 美元，再赔对方律师费。提出这部法的，是这个州总检察长的妻子。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">加州高铁</span><span class=\"tag\">调查报道</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"238. 特斯拉之后，汽车行业改变的不是动力，而是一整套游戏规则丨串台「Freda下午茶」 D2C DMS global consistency Tier 1 / Tier 2 VinFast\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-18-beiwanglu-特斯拉真正的颠覆不是电动-而是重写了汽车业游戏规则/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c56ff7e702000290-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"贝\"><span class=\"dur\">1:36:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">贝望录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>特斯拉真正的颠覆不是电动，而是重写了汽车业游戏规则</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">传统车企不是没看到特斯拉，而是把它当成细分市场的新玩具；真正被颠覆的是七年一改款的节奏、经销商体系和供应链利益，这些包袱让它们转不了身。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">汽车出海</span><span class=\"tag\">新能源汽车</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"外滩大会线下圆桌｜敢把钱包交给AI吗？聊聊Agent交易爆发前夜的信任基建 KYA Agentic Commerce Harness A2A Superbloom\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-18-sv101-把钱包交给-ai-之前-支付网络得先重写一遍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cfe8fa9f8e3fa476-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"硅\"><span class=\"dur\">35:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">硅谷101</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>把钱包交给 AI 之前，支付网络得先重写一遍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">四位嘉宾里只有一位真的用 Agent 付过钱，花了 40 多块。万事达卡说真正的卡点不在技术，而在让普通消费者发自内心愿意相信一个智能体。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">智能体支付</span><span class=\"tag\">信任基建</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Exxon’s Office Fling Jersey Standard dedicated word processor Directly Reduced Iron (DRI)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-asianometry-石油巨头去做打字机-做到施乐那么大也只是桶里一滴油/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6f647fbb2223b0a9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">25:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>石油巨头去做打字机，做到施乐那么大也只是桶里一滴油</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1978 年埃克森把文字处理器、智能打字机和传真机合并成 Exxon Information Systems，去挑战 IBM。它输掉的不是技术，而是自己的体量：做到施乐那么大，也只等于桶里一滴油。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企业史</span><span class=\"tag\">多元化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"300 高市早苗支持率高位横盘 内阁改组政坛进入多事之秋 Middle Power Japan&#x27;s back 中道\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-eastasia-冲绳变天不是亲中派落败-是年轻人认命要实惠/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/86e8f4dd3d50b302-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"东\"><span class=\"dur\">1:25:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">东亚观察局</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>冲绳变天不是亲中派落败，是年轻人认命要实惠</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">冲绳知事选举，反对美军基地的一方执政近二十年后败选。这不是左右转向，也不是对华态度变了：抗争几十年基地一步没动，年轻选民认了命，先要眼前的经济实惠。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">日本政治</span><span class=\"tag\">高市早苗</span>\n</div></div></a>"]